<title>USA: PHP Healthcare adds directors.</title>
<headline>PHP Healthcare adds directors.</headline>
<dateline>RESTON, Va. 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>PHP Healthcare Corp said on Wednesday that it has added four new directors, increasing its board to 12 members.</p>
<p>The four new directors are John McDonnell, PHP executive vice president William Lubin, Jerry Carlton, and Dr. Frank Provato, a PHP executive vice president.</p>
<p>McDonnell is the co-founder, chairman and chief executive of Coagulation Diagnostics Inc, of Bethesda, Maryland.</p>
<p>Carlton is managing partner of the law firm O'Melveny &amp; Myers in Newport Beach, Calif.</p>
